# ============================================
# Documentation (selective)
# ============================================

## Keep essential root-level docs
!README.md
!CLAUDE.md
!LICENSE

## Ignore all other root-level markdown temporarily
/*.md
!README.md
!CLAUDE.md
!REORGANIZATION_PLAN.md

## Archive outdated docs
docs/archive/
docs/trial_options/
docs/OHBM_abstract/

